From: OfficeDroid contributors
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: include strings.h for the inline LDT bitmap helper

NDK r28c / Android API 29 does not declare ffs through string.h.
The inline helper in unix_private.h must include the declaration itself.
Based on Wine 11.0 db11d0fe6a169c457e23d007e20404643d067aa8.
This Wine modification is LGPL-2.1-or-later, like the modified file.

--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/unix_private.h
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/unix_private.h
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 
 #include <pthread.h>
 #include <signal.h>
+#include <strings.h>
 #include "unixlib.h"
 #include "wine/unixlib.h"
 #include "wine/server.h"
